  "notes": "No equipment failures per Section G; the trip was purely a personnel-error-induced unplanned de-energization of an in-service RAT during relay routine work. EDG start was an automatic, per-design response, not a failure mode, so it is modeled as Consequence/backup rather than a failure. Bus 12 (BU) is modeled as an involved System since relay routines were being performed on it; no PART_OF edges asserted since narrative only describes functional/power relationships. 1/2 EDG being out for planned maintenance at event onset is contextual (TS 3.8.1 Condition B) but not part of the causal chain for the RAT trip itself, so not modeled as a failure mode."
